          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bayasha mwene Ahiya wo mu muryango wa Isakari, ategura umugambi wo kwica umwami. Igihe Nadabu n’ingabo za Isirayeli bari bateye igisagara ca Gibetoni caganzwa n’Abafilisitiya, Bayasha yica umwami Nadabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bayasha yishe Nadabu mu mwaka ugira gatatu Asa ari ku ngoma y’i Buyuda. Bayasha aca aba umwami, asubirira Nadabu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
